# Copy to .env.web (ignored by Git) for the hermes-web service, which serves the /ukk page.
# Only the model key. Never put TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN here: the web instance refuses to start with it,
# and only one machine may poll the Telegram token.
NVIDIA_API_KEY=
# API_SERVER_KEY comes from UKK_API_KEY in .env.local via Compose; the Engine settings come from there too.
